00:00:40.033 --> 00:00:41.734
because I've been going,
going, going.

00:00:41.734 --> 00:00:43.033
-Yeah.
-It's important to have

00:00:43.033 --> 00:00:45.067
those moments where you're like,
"Wow, this album

00:00:45.067 --> 00:00:48.033
that it was a two-year
journey for me

00:00:48.033 --> 00:00:51.267
and this album
and the journey of it

00:00:51.267 --> 00:00:53.634
